  "motion": {
    "_doc": "Longer than a transition: what loops and long plays take, each named for the loop it was measured on. `turn` a spinner's turn, a flash going out; `pulse` a beat (a timer's last seconds); `flare` a ring thrown from a burst; `ping` a ping going out; `sweep` an indeterminate bar's pass; `breathe` a waiting thing's breath, a shell's flight; `sheen` a light crossing a bar; `drift` a liquid's sway; `fanfare` a reward held on screen; `orbit` a ring's slow turn.",
